  "description": "Born an alpha, entertainment agency CEO Chae Jae-woon suddenly becomes an omega after eating a peach.\nHaving lost more than half his assets in a divorce settlement, Jae-woon is thrilled when rising star Lee San-woo signs an exclusive contract with him - like a winning lottery ticket walking through his door ... But his joy doesn’t last long.\n\n*“President, can I just sleep with you once?”*\n\nSan-woo turns out to be not only scandal-prone but also shamelessly lusting after his divorced boss, propositioning him every time their eyes meet.\n\n*“Don’t you dare put it in! I’m allergic to alphas!”  \n“Yeah, right.”*\n\nNow an omega with the added curse of alpha allergy, Jae-woon desperately tries to fend off San-woo’s relentless advances…\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/3885005008), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13631766), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000085007)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/3885042112), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/BLteukgang_4gyosi), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/omega_job_ethics), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000074988)",
